  "prediction": "The report provides essential resources for congressional staff seeking to understand legislative procedures and processes. The report recommends visiting the House and Senate \"Legislative Process\" websites for official overviews and explanatory information. Additionally, several key publications are listed to help staff gain a deeper understanding of the rules and procedures of the House and Senate. These include the House Parliamentarian's \"House Rules and Manual,\" \"House Practice,\" and \"Senate Manual.\" The report also mentions several out-of-print publications, such as \"Deschler-Brown,\" \"Precedents of the U.S. House of Representatives,\" and \"Precedents of the U.S. Senate,\" which are available in multivolume sets on the Government Publishing Office's (GPO) website. The report concludes by encouraging staff to utilize the Congressional Research Service (CRS) for additional resources and information on legislative procedure.",
  "scored_prediction": "The report provides essential resources for congressional staff seeking to understand legislative procedures and processes. The report recommends visiting the House and Senate \"Legislative Process\" websites for official overviews and explanatory information. Additionally, several key publications are listed to help staff gain a deeper understanding of the rules and procedures of the House and Senate. These include the House Parliamentarian's \"House Rules and Manual,\" \"House Practice,\" and \"Senate Manual.\" The report also mentions several out-of-print publications, such as \"Deschler-Brown,\" \"Precedents of the U.S. House of Representatives,\" and \"Precedents of the U.S. Senate,\" which are available in multivolume sets on the Government Publishing Office's (GPO) website. The report concludes by encouraging staff to utilize the Congressional Research Service (CRS) for additional resources and information on legislative procedure.",
  "score": 25.19684994085189,
  "answers": [
    "Written for congressional staff, this report identifies and provides details on how to obtain information on legislative procedures and process in the House and Senate. It provides references to selected CRS products and offers information on the CRS legislative institutes. A listing of selected supplementary materials is also provided. This report will be updated as new information is available."
